sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code
    participant Exp as AI4RAGExperiment
    participant GAM as GAMOptimizer
    participant MPS as ModelsPreSelector
    participant SS as SearchSpace
    participant Template as SimpleRAGTemplate
    participant Chunker as Chunker<br/>(LangChain/Docling)
    participant Embed as EmbeddingModel<br/>(OGX)
    participant VS as VectorStore<br/>(OGX/ChromaDB)
    participant FM as FoundationModel<br/>(OGX)
    participant Eval as Evaluator<br/>(Unitxt/LLMaJ)
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 1: RAG Optimization Experiment
        User->>Exp: search(search_space, benchmark_data)
        Exp->>SS: validate constraints & generate combinations
        SS-->>Exp: valid parameter combinations

        opt Model Pre-Selection (many models)
            Exp->>MPS: pre_select(models, sample_benchmark)
            MPS->>OGX: POST /embeddings<br/>API Key Auth
            OGX-->>MPS: embedding vectors
            Note over MPS: In-memory ChromaDB<br/>for quick evaluation
            MPS-->>Exp: top-N models
        end

        loop For each optimization iteration
            Exp->>GAM: suggest_next(evaluated_results)
            GAM-->>Exp: next parameter set (RAG Pattern)

            Note over Exp,Template: Build RAG pipeline with selected parameters
            Exp->>Template: configure(chunker, embedder, retriever, FM)

            Note over Template,OGX: Index documents
            Template->>Chunker: chunk(documents)
            Chunker-->>Template: chunks (with SHA-256 IDs)
            Template->>Embed: embed(chunks)
            Embed->>OGX: POST /embeddings<br/>API Key Auth, TLS
            OGX-->>Embed: embedding vectors
            Template->>VS: create_collection & insert(vectors)
            VS->>OGX: POST /vector_stores, POST /vector_io<br/>API Key Auth, TLS
            OGX-->>VS: ack

            Note over Template,OGX: Run inference on benchmark
            loop For each benchmark question
                Template->>VS: query(question_embedding)
                VS->>OGX: POST /vector_io/query<br/>API Key Auth, TLS
                OGX-->>VS: relevant chunks
                VS-->>Template: context documents
                Template->>FM: generate(question + context)
                FM->>OGX: POST /chat/completions<br/>API Key Auth, TLS
                OGX-->>FM: generated answer
                FM-->>Template: answer
            end

            Template-->>Exp: predictions + contexts

            Note over Exp,Eval: Evaluate RAG Pattern quality
            Exp->>Eval: evaluate(predictions, ground_truth)
            Note over Eval: Unitxt: correctness, faithfulness<br/>LLMaJ: answer relevance
            Eval-->>Exp: scores (per metric)

            Exp->>GAM: update(params, scores)
        end

        Exp-->>User: best RAG Pattern + all results
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 2: Document Discovery & Text Extraction (KFP)
        User->>S3: list_objects_v2(bucket, prefix)<br/>AWS IAM Auth, TLS
        S3-->>User: object keys (documents)
        User->>S3: download_file(key)<br/>AWS IAM Auth, TLS (SSL fallback)
        S3-->>User: raw documents (PDF, DOCX, etc.)
        Note over User: Docling DocumentConverter<br/>(multiprocess spawn pool)
        User->>User: convert & extract text
        Note over User: Optional: download Docling models
        User-->>User: DoclingDocuments (extracted text)
    end
